# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - No RMSE/MAE is reported in the text read. GAP-20U+gr is a refit with the GAP-20U settings on the extended data, not a fine-tune, so no base model is recorded. Tersoff and EDIP are classical potentials and not encoded.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
